   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ENH401 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 9 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 11908 · Decision 862/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 16/08/2024 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ENH401 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>9 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 11908 · QĐ 862/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 16/08/2024 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Use continuous aspect<br>Apply vocabulary to describe tourist motivations and visuals<br>Apply professional skills when using visuals<br>Tailor a package</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Use countable and uncountable nouns<br>Use vocabulary in advertising and publicity, web words, collocations<br>Apply professional skills when maintaining a website<br>Create and improve a media profile</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Make predictions<br>Use vocabulary for brands<br>Apply professional skills when creating a business plan<br>Know how to invest in a hotel</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Use reporting verbs<br>Use verb + noun collocations; use vocabulary related to tourism and community<br>Apply professional skills when chairing a meeting<br>Develop an eco-resort</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Use grammar to talk about the past<br>Use vocabulary to describing a heritage site, architecture, guiding expressions<br>Apply professional skills when working as a tour guide<br>Design a museum exhibition</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Use conditional forms to describe hypothetical situations<br>Discuss different kinds of large event by using collocations with event<br>Apply professional skills of understanding contracts<br>Make a festival profitable</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Use dependent prepositions<br>Use vocabulary concerned with remuneration; adjectives describing personality<br>Apply professional skills in interviews<br>Recruit the right person</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>CLO8</strong></td><td>Use relative clauses<br>Use vocabulary for food and cooking<br>Apply professional skills when giving feedback<br>Plan a new itinerary</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td><strong>CLO9</strong></td><td>Use modal verbs<br>UsevVocabulary to describe disasters, adventure sports<br>Apply professional skills when dealing with crises</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11908\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11908</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11908\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11908</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
